    <string name="onboarding_page1_title">Breathe your way calm</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page1_body">Guided breathing sessions for calm, focus, sleep, and stressful moments. Follow the orb and let your shoulders drop.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_title">Check in with yourself</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_body">Log your mood in seconds, spot patterns over time, and build a streak of calmer days.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_title">Wind down and rest</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_body">Soothing generated soundscapes and a gentle wind-down timer help you drift off. Your data stays on your device.</string>
