    <string name="settings_privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_sub">How Aura handles your data</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">Aura keeps your wellbeing data on your device. Mood check-ins, journal entries, breathing sessions, and sleep sessions are stored locally and never uploaded to our servers.\n\nHealth data (such as resting heart rate or sleep duration) is read only with your permission, only to compute your stress score, and never leaves your phone.\n\nThis is a placeholder policy. The full privacy policy ships before the Play Store release.</string>

